# This directory sits inside the project, so Apache serves it as URLs like
# /Capstone2/docker/php/php.ini whether or not anything links to it -- the same
# reason backend/api/, backend/uploads/ and backend/database/ each carry a file
# like this one.
#
# Nothing in here is secret; the container's database password is a compose
# default and is meant to be changed. But these files describe the deployment,
# and none of them is ever fetched by the front end, so there is no reason for
# any of them to answer a request.
Require all denied
